stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  [*] --> Held : CreateHold<br/>(checks availability +<br/>FOR UPDATE row lock on PG)

  Held --> Confirmed : ConfirmHold<br/>(within ExpiresAt window)
  Held --> Released  : ReleaseHold<br/>(manual cancel)
  Held --> Expired   : HoldExpirySweepJob<br/>(every 5 min, Hangfire)
  Held --> Held      : ExtendHold<br/>(max 3 extensions,<br/>adds TenantSettings.HoldTtlHours)

  Confirmed --> Released : ReleaseHold<br/>(post-confirmation cancel)

  Released --> [*]
  Expired  --> [*]

  note right of Held
    Slot rules:
      whole-day collides with everything
      slot collides with same slot OR whole-day
    Quantity rules:
      AssetResource → quantity must be 1
      PoolResource  → quantity ≤ DefaultCapacity (overridable per date via Calendar)
  end note

  note right of Confirmed
    ExpiresAt is cleared on confirmation.
    A confirmed hold is the source of truth
    for future booking integrations.
  end note

  note right of Expired
    Terminal state.
    ReleaseHold rejects: "Hold is in terminal state".
    Capacity freed for the next CreateHold.
  end note
